              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me agege me loc abaka Kuro me Pacia, i mwaka-nono en ame Rwot obin otugo iye cunye en abaka Kuro me cwalo cik romo lobo mere luŋ, kun daŋ mio ocoo acoa me kwan i lobo mere luŋ, Man otimere me kop a rik Rwot omio amiro mere adwarpiny Jeremia okobo cobere kakare, Koppere-nono rik ocoo ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
